{"data": [{"author_id": "1308990535357652993", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:01:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116545999774843255"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TKe8zyIFRk", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/kumawataman13/status/2116545999774843255/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116545972641857537", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/TKe8zyIFRk"}]}, "id": "2116545999774843255", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NVIDIA only designs the chip; it doesn't manufacture it.\n\nLet's break down the complete semiconductor ecosystem and understand what each company does.\n\n(1) Chip Architecture &amp; Design\n\nCompanies: NVIDIA, AMD\n\nThese companies design the chip architecture, including GPU cores, https://t.co/TKe8zyIFRk", "url": "https://x.com/kumawataman13/status/2116545999774843255"}, {"author_id": "1412045422483283971", "created_at": "2026-10-31T04:09:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116381958313750589"], "id": "2116381958313750589", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 151, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【3.3倍→5.5倍→14倍】CoWoS（コワス）って何？なぜAI半導体の「詰まり」になるの？\n\nCoWoSはTSMCの先端パッケージ技術。GPUとHBM（積み重ねたメモリ）を1枚の「中継板」の上に並べてつなぎます。\n\n中継板の大きさ（露光1回分＝約858mm²の何倍か）\nCoWoS-S 最大3.3倍（約2,700mm²）\nCoWoS-L", "url": "https://x.com/GoToFIRE147755/status/2116381958313750589"}, {"author_id": "1838943895129927680", "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:59:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116364380354871449"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/aH1BWIXgDH", "end": 260, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/QubbleOfficial/status/2116364380354871449/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116364315749961728", "start": 237, "url": "https://t.co/aH1BWIXgDH"}]}, "id": "2116364380354871449", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "HBM and CoWoS bottlenecks don't just throttle AI training — they stall the validator hardware refresh that would migrate consensus off ECDSA. TSMC price power + packaging queue = structural delay baked into the trust layer. Per SemiEng. https://t.co/aH1BWIXgDH", "url": "https://x.com/QubbleOfficial/status/2116364380354871449"}, {"author_id": "1482283068555546627", "created_at": "2026-10-30T14:24:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116174415503528240"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/GT2ktDgkPf", "end": 290, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ricci_nov/status/2116174415503528240/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116174412286451712", "start": 267, "url": "https://t.co/GT2ktDgkPf"}]}, "id": "2116174415503528240", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SemiEngineering week: TSMC said to weigh ~20% CoWoS hikes; ASE sees advanced-packaging revenue doubling in 2027; CXMT plans limited HBM3E at ~20–30% yields (Reuters); Solidigm reportedly talks a ~$45B U.S. NAND fab; Anthropic IPO flags HBM/TSMC capacity constraints. https://t.co/GT2ktDgkPf", "url": "https://x.com/ricci_nov/status/2116174415503528240"}, {"author_id": "1828694705506500608", "created_at": "2026-10-30T08:32:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116085724240105783"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/PGSAtWEdHa", "end": 306, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JSCC2020Lee/status/2116085724240105783/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116085717608861696", "start": 283, "url": "https://t.co/PGSAtWEdHa"}]}, "id": "2116085724240105783", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 140, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Banks lock $63B structure to fund Broadcom XPU accelerators and networking leased to Anthropic starting 2027.\n1/ Key Numbers &amp; Facts: • $63B SPV financing (BofA, Blacks