uote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NVIDIA Spectrum-X Photonics CPO switches enter production as optical-engine capacity targets 15x expansion by mid-2027 with volume ramp in 2027-2028.\n1/ Key Numbers &amp; Facts: • NVIDIA-SPIL optical-engine capacity: 15x by mid-2027, further doubling by end-2028 (~30x total) • https://t.co/t2cLyVJyG8", "url": "https://x.com/JSCC2020Lee/status/2115953298415223203"}, {"author_id": "785856172209373184", "created_at": "2026-10-31T07:42:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116435719942017149"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/gGMfBMRwBt", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2116435719942017149/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116435716666281984", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/gGMfBMRwBt"}]}, "id": "2116435719942017149", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 88, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "☕ La semaine IA &amp; semi-conducteurs en 12 points ↓\n\n1) Intel — Guidage cassé, cash burn et choc de confiance\n\nIntel a publié un T3 au‑dessus du consensus mais a guidé en forte baisse, signalant un cash burn pour l’année et des vents contraires PC prolongés; le titre a chuté de https://t.co/gGMfBMRwBt", "url": "https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2116435719942017149"}, {"author_id": "2106332039955791872", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:52:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116498503027360122"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/dt2sf5Yb5l", "end": 312, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheLazyNode/status/2116498503027360122/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116497704284983296", "start": 289, "url": "https://t.co/dt2sf5Yb5l"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/dt2sf5Yb5l", "end": 312, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheLazyNode/status/2116498503027360122/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116497704306016257", "start": 289, "url": "https://t.co/dt2sf5Yb5l"}]}, "id": "2116498503027360122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 124, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Lazy Node Network\nEDITION: Most engagement on X (past 24 hours) Categories: Tech, AI, Cyber Security, Crypto, Space, Aerospace, Processors &amp; Semiconductors\n\nTech &amp; AI\n\nOpenAI reportedly cuts latest funding target by $10 billion amid AI market selloff\n\nThe Financial Times reported https://t.co/dt2sf5Yb5l", "url": "https://x.com/TheLazyNode/status/2116498503027360122"}, {"author_id": "915580080432148482", "created_at": "2026-10-30T15:02:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116183855266942998"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ApxlwuJbP9", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/anton_d_leicht/status/2116183855266942998/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116183850846191616", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/ApxlwuJbP9"}]}, "id": "2116183855266942998", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 2499, "like_count": 48, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Semiconductor chokepoints are huge strategic assets: Taiwan is building its Silicon Shield, Korea is near-untouchable due to HBM, America is building AGI with Nvidia chips.\n\nYet despite ASML, Europe captures little AI value and even less strategic leverage. Why?\n\n(1) No BATNA. If https://t.co/ApxlwuJbP9", "url": "https://x.com/anton_d_leicht/status/2116183855266942998"}, {"author_id": "1873575663405572096", "created_at": "2026-10-31T09:26:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116461711762882581"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 59, "id": "1943306828697550848", "start": 50, "username": "claudeai"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/IsyhK34NGT", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BretKerr/status/2116461711762882581/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116461707778248704", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/IsyhK34NGT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/IsyhK34NGT", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BretKerr/status/2116461711762882581/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116461707765628928", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/IsyhK34NGT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/IsyhK34NGT", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BretKerr/status/2116461711762882581/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116461707778224128", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/IsyhK34NGT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/IsyhK34NGT", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BretKerr/status/2116461711762882581/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116461707757309953", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/IsyhK34NGT"}, {"display_url": "x.com/bretkerr/statu…", "end": 323, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/bretkerr/status/2116452125890732256", "start": 300, "url": "https://t.co/hF3dG2utnZ"}]}, "id": "2116461711762882581", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 162, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116452125890732256", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This morning I posted Clawd Builds Its Own House: @claudeai writes and checks the chip, humans print it. Then I ran it through the bifurcated loop. Gemini mapped the stack. GPT was told to kill it. The caption survived. The floor plan didn't. 🧵\n\nDesign really is speeding up. https://t.co/IsyhK34NGT https://t.co/hF3dG2utnZ", "url": "https://x.com/BretKerr/status/2116461711762882581"}, {"author_id": "178396704", "created_at": "2026-10-30T15:09:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116185774689333635"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 11, "start": 6, "tag": "INTC"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/IngJuanPa7/sta…", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/IngJuanPa7/status/2115899190941565152", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/qqL0KXLz1E"}]}, "id": "2116185774689333635", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 686, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115899190941565152", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Intel $INTC se desploma cerca de un 29% y se encamina hacia la peor sesión bursátil de su historia, con una pérdida potencial de más de 137.000 millones de dólares en capitalización. La caída está arrastrando al conjunto del sector de semiconductores, en medio de las https://t.co/qqL0KXLz1E", "url": "https://x.com/IngJuanPa7/status/2116185774689333635"}, {"author_id": "1790868238949339137", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:05:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116290417771806807"], "id": "2116290417771806807", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1034, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "📉 AI 반도체는 부족한데, 공급과잉은 언제 오는가?\nAI SEMICONDUCTOR SUPPLY CYCLE\n\n반도체 시장 심층 분석 3편\n\nAI GPU와 HBM은 여전히 공급이 부족합니다.\n\n그런데 반도체 기업들은 막대한 자금을 투자하며 생산능력을 확대하고 있습니다.\n\n저는 여기서 중요한 질문이 하나 생긴다고 생각합니다.", "url": "https://x.com/jinseongeo83473/status/2116290417771806807"}, {"article": {"title": "Bellek döngüsü: 2027 kıtlık, 2028 arz dalgası mı?"}, "author_id": "1858245614397685760", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:31:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116100783200477374"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2116…", "end": 92, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2116098311241232384", "start": 69, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2116098311241232384", "url": "https://t.co/Lge9CAYXFS"}]}, "id": "2116100783200477374", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 124, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Bellek çiplerinde sıradaki dalga: 2027'de kıtlık, 2028'de bolluk mu? https://t.co/Lge9CAYXFS", "url": "https://x.com/submarinetrader/status/2116100783200477374"}, {"author_id": "1270850183270563840", "created_at": "2026-10-30T08:06:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116079247676879112"], "id": "2116079247676879112", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 10848, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "【レーザーテック決算、コンセンサス44%未達。AI半導体需要に陰りなのか？】\n\n2027年6月期1Q経常利益は147億円。市場予想263億円を約44%下回る厳しい内容。\n\nただし、今回の未達をAI半導体需要の減速と直結させるのは早計では？\n\n■ 決算内容を詳しく見ると\n　※生産は伸びている", "url": "https://x.com/semicon_eng1/status/2116079247676879112"}, {"author_id": "1878424909476761600", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:53:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116513812920647788"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/vrwnACgBMZ", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2116513812920647788/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116512923514249216", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/vrwnACgBMZ"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/vrwnACgBMZ", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2116513812920647788/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116512923518377984", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/vrwnACgBMZ"}]}, "id": "2116513812920647788", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CoWoS-L hides small silicon bridges in an RDL interposer, so the finest wiring sits only under chip boundaries. Tech Daily | No. 11 of 16\n\nTSMC says 3.5-reticle CoWoS-L has been in production since 2024. NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang said Blackwell uses largely CoWoS-L. More in reply. https://t.co/vrwnACgBMZ", "url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2116513812920647788"}, {"author_id": "973200602", "created_at": "2026-10-30T00:50:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115969445327954233"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "SynopsysとTSMCは、先端半導体設計分野での協業を拡大する。TSMCの「A14」プロセス向けEDAフローを整備したほか、エージェント型AIを活用してアナログ／デジタル／マルチダイ設計の自動化を進める。先端パッケージング技術「CoWoS」を用いたマルチダイ設計や、「N2P」プロセス向けIP（Intellectual Property）の拡充にも取り組む。", "display_url": "eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/26…", "end": 88, "expanded_url": "https://eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/2609/30/news059.html", "images": [{"height": 418, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115969452244373505/E1T2UYZx?format=jpg&name=orig", "wid